      "created_at": "2020-04-18T23:36:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Have you ever had players decide they need to make an Overcome roll in a scene without a Scene Tracker, so all the heroes who aren't making the roll all decide to generate bonuses?</p>\n<p>This hasn't (yet) happened to me, but I know my players and I know this will definitely come up.&nbsp; Is there a limiting rule I don't recall or is this just a \"no, you can't do that.\"</p>\n<p>I can see *some* situations where it makes narrative sense, but I can also see players asking why they couldn't all just add bonuses as a sort of \"Take 20\"?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:43.895Z",
