      "id": 230300,
      "name": "ErekLich",
      "username": "ErekLich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-19T17:34:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Tbh I'm with the players here.&nbsp; If there's no rush, why shouldn't they all put their heads together and make sure something gets done right?</p>\n<p>If you don't want this to happen, then make it a montage scene instead of a full scene, or else just rule that they don't need an overcome for the thing in question - after all, the rules say you shouldn't roll when there are no stakes.</p>",
