      "id": 230301,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-20T16:53:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If there's literally no rush, then they can all stack bonuses infinitely and get a 12+ on every single roll.&nbsp; That would indeed be a no-stakes situation and there's no point in rolling.</p>\n<p>There's no rule against this, so you'd have to manage it some other way.&nbsp; Making boosts off-limits in the absence of a threat of some sort would be one way.</p>",
