      "username": "der_andere_Jan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/der_andere_jan/{size}/1881_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-26T23:52:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The rules say you can produce one bonus by preparing for the next&nbsp;scene.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'd think to interprete that \"one\" very literally, thus not allowing any stacking (because that would require multiple boost actions).</p>\n<p>Knowing players, maybe you'll have to remind them not to break the game.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Or throw in a pointless scripted challenge first thing in the next scene, so the bonus gets wasted.</p>",
